{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00224",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 5.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Excuse me, uh, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.67,
      "end_seconds": 8.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.99,
      "end_seconds": 21.38,
      "duration_seconds": 12.39,
      "text": "I've been feeling very thirsty. I've never really been one for hospitals. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, um, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.66,
      "end_seconds": 24.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.36,
      "end_seconds": 28.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Since yesterday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.88,
      "end_seconds": 34.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.3,
      "end_seconds": 47.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.32,
      "text": "I'd say severe. I've been losing weight without trying too. Oh, and itching around the private area. Right, uh, with itching around the private area, I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.85,
      "end_seconds": 50.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Any vomiting or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.16,
      "end_seconds": 56.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Uh, you know, no vomiting or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.95,
      "end_seconds": 63.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Any breathlessness or fruity smell on the breath at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.1,
      "end_seconds": 67.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Hmm, no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.64,
      "end_seconds": 70.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.53,
      "end_seconds": 73.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.16,
      "end_seconds": 75.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.04,
      "end_seconds": 78.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.22,
      "end_seconds": 82.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.39,
      "end_seconds": 90.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Yes, asthma. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.99,
      "end_seconds": 95.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.94,
      "end_seconds": 109.76,
      "duration_seconds": 13.82,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.88,
      "end_seconds": 113.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.17,
      "end_seconds": 119.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Yes, dust. I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.43,
      "end_seconds": 124.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.71,
      "end_seconds": 144.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Right, carry on. What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.19,
      "end_seconds": 148.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Seretide inhaler. I take it twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.98,
      "end_seconds": 153.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.83,
      "end_seconds": 161.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.03,
      "end_seconds": 165.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.89,
      "end_seconds": 178.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.08,
      "end_seconds": 208.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.43,
      "text": "Okay: weight 74 kilos, BP is 122 over 71, pulse is 66 beats a minute, temp 36.8 degrees, BMI works out to 25.0, height 172 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.63,
      "end_seconds": 211.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.18,
      "end_seconds": 217.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.81,
      "end_seconds": 238.04,
      "duration_seconds": 19.23,
      "text": "Not really, uh, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.44,
      "end_seconds": 242.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.51,
      "end_seconds": 246.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.05,
      "end_seconds": 266.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and non-tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.69,
      "end_seconds": 269.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.33,
      "end_seconds": 283.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "You're a little dry, but alert, and your breathing is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.35,
      "end_seconds": 293.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.38,
      "end_seconds": 297.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.78,
      "end_seconds": 298.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.62,
      "end_seconds": 325.73,
      "duration_seconds": 16.11,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like possible new-onset diabetes. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling very thirsty, since yesterday, severe, and no vomiting or breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.28,
      "end_seconds": 330.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.68,
      "end_seconds": 343.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "I'm going to order a urine test, for polyuria. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.01,
      "end_seconds": 348.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Um, sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.48,
      "end_seconds": 354.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Let's get an HbA1c, for possible diabetes. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.29,
      "end_seconds": 359.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Right, sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.87,
      "end_seconds": 366.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "Until we have the results, avoid sugary drinks and fruit juices, and keep drinking plain water."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.08,
      "end_seconds": 378.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.55,
      "text": "Alright. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Please don't sit on it if you start vomiting or become drowsy. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.44,
      "end_seconds": 381.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Right, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.77,
      "end_seconds": 390.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "Let's review you tomorrow with the results. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.46,
      "end_seconds": 398.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "So, I come back tomorrow with the results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.61,
      "end_seconds": 404.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 405.0,
      "end_seconds": 407.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Thanks so much, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.3,
      "end_seconds": 410.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}